    11. Convert the difference to the desired currency unit (e.g., divide cents by 100 to get EUR).
    12. If the difference is within the allowed threshold (e.g., 3 EUR) and there are zero missing products, the comparison is successful; otherwise, it fails.
    13. Return an appropriate outcome with the computed difference and missing count.
    
